{"w":7029,"page":93,"lines":[{"x":0.061187197922118755,"w":0.77767830390434745,"y":0.93040335155660359,"h":0.030616699703155947,"text":"\"Ach, ich habe keine Feinde, denn wir Menschen lieben","conf":1},{"w":0.74109263234324263,"text":"einander nicht einmal so sehr, um uns Feinde zu sein.","y":0.91269841285283015,"h":0.021894610117352165,"x":0.11163896439844977,"conf":1},{"x":0.080534752091089859,"text":"Aber ich habe einen Feind, einen gewaltigen Feind,","conf":1,"y":0.88796384049838295,"w":0.71784621399718451,"h":0.026686210480947326},{"w":0.66140672758028107,"text":"der mich berennt und an alle meine Tore pocht.","y":0.86522471122993894,"x":0.096943999724759394,"h":0.029451214131854808,"conf":1},{"h":0.030978026844206363,"text":"\"Ich habe einen Feind, mein Vater, der meine edle Rede","conf":1,"x":0.061191788021622014,"y":0.82962566371661639,"w":0.79191178160828424},{"y":0.81079748742956759,"text":"in Geschwätz verkehrt und in Selbstbetrug.","x":0.108859410631008,"w":0.5947404836679433,"conf":1,"h":0.026141940601288383},{"conf":1,"x":0.080760105335058494,"w":0.80285035170517949,"h":0.023348098709469745,"text":"Ich habe einen Feind, der mein Gewissen liebedienerisch","y":0.78769841281549224},{"w":0.087885986674915678,"conf":1,"text":"macht","h":0.015988372621082103,"x":0.14489311148439488,"y":0.7718023254772497},{"text":"und meine Liebe mid Trägheit erstickt . ..","conf":1,"x":0.11137002260901052,"y":0.74242799364757384,"h":0.02456422079177123,"w":0.59205954415457585},{"x":0.058752559667907676,"w":0.82302806903789572,"h":0.034826078112163206,"conf":1,"text":"\"Warum hast Du mich mit diesem Feind erschaffen, mein","y":0.70229455545509545},{"x":0.14247715248128659,"conf":1,"y":0.68347593206371093,"text":"Vater,","w":0.095798523395092455,"h":0.02436655854421943},{"text":"warum mich zu dieser Zweiheit gemacht?","w":0.57745856743354307,"h":0.022712374490404863,"conf":1,"y":0.66090614292422623,"x":0.11150846494894796},{"h":0.020585317460317443,"y":0.64087301552742248,"conf":1,"text":"Warum gabst Du mir nicht Einheit und Reinheit?","w":0.68646081701501627,"x":0.078384789849578293},{"h":0.023319260468558589,"y":0.61482558123666586,"x":0.1116389580833758,"w":0.51068883127980425,"conf":1,"text":"Reinige, einige mich, o Du Gewässer!"},{"w":0.82490257164100533,"conf":1,"text":"\"Befreie mich, reinige mich, mein Vater, töte diesen Feind,","h":0.029229971151503387,"y":0.57750351689050561,"x":0.056666922634112736},{"text":"töte mich, ertränke diesen Mich!\"1","y":0.56101190516439492,"h":0.020383443151201552,"w":0.48456058254489642,"conf":1,"x":0.1092636500577181},{"conf":1,"text":"In answer to this prayer there sounds the word of Jesus:","y":0.52909537975038745,"w":0.78645433698381695,"h":0.023268366616869707,"x":0.092516055685494661},{"conf":1,"x":0.057007153756431297,"y":0.50719246020361419,"w":0.8218526964063767,"h":0.024801587301587324,"text":"\"Peace I leave with you, my peace I give to you.\" Such a"},{"h":0.021900378522418884,"conf":1,"w":0.81710211023107748,"text":"word frees us from our inner division, and slays the enemy","x":0.061757735086361502,"y":0.4853670633685484},{"y":0.46502976178181576,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.01909722222222221,"text":"we harbour within ourselves. For this is the word of love","conf":1,"x":0.059382426169032415},{"h":0.023736352012270978,"w":0.81738717215401779,"y":0.44138935041215421,"text":"which gives us the assurance that God does not see us as","x":0.059226384803635256,"conf":1},{"text":"those who we see ourselves in our inner distress to be, but","conf":1,"x":0.059142000312142229,"y":0.41658915982837486,"w":0.8223558896547789,"h":0.02692325342269164},{"x":0.059382419268795041,"conf":1,"w":0.81947742808948865,"text":"as those who are purified and unified in the embrace of His","y":0.39533730162463931,"h":0.020360372369251589},{"x":0.080760099810609803,"y":0.36773255850702014,"conf":1,"w":0.17339666787680094,"text":"1 Franz Werfel:","h":0.014534883082859107},{"x":0.11619485183282843,"h":0.019837700185321605,"y":0.34214894477844415,"text":"\"Your psalmist, O my Father, sang to denounce his enemies,","conf":1,"w":0.65122901619254769},{"conf":1,"text":"And I, my Father, follow suit and sing a psalm against my foes!","x":0.13301662916255377,"y":0.32986111110951,"h":0.017609126984126977,"w":0.67933491298130588},{"w":0.57482181895862927,"conf":1,"x":0.11876486967745481,"y":0.30952380975433491,"h":0.016121031746031744,"text":"\"But alas! I have no enemies, for we men do not love"},{"conf":1,"y":0.29505813985391938,"h":0.014534883082859107,"w":0.43942993956726861,"x":0.13539192407028477,"text":"Each other enough to make real enemies."},{"text":"But I have an enemy, a powerful enemy,","x":0.1330166161724228,"y":0.28050595230061026,"w":0.43942993956726861,"h":0.014632936507936511,"conf":1},{"text":"Who assaults me and hammers at all my gates.","w":0.50157948283406051,"y":0.26542724458267586,"conf":1,"h":0.017820761317298595,"x":0.13282731155578528},{"conf":1,"text":"\"I have an enemy, my Father, who turns my noble speech","y":0.24127907004053994,"h":0.01889534791310632,"w":0.62470309765307941,"x":0.11163894787179768},{"conf":1,"x":0.12826603393569339,"w":0.38479809946828081,"y":0.22965116272652297,"h":0.015988372621082103,"text":"Into idle chatter and self-deception."},{"conf":1,"h":0.016121031746031744,"y":0.21502976220532866,"w":0.67458432680600644,"x":0.13064133502930064,"text":"I have an enemy who makes my conscience to serve my desires,"},{"w":0.33729216340300328,"conf":1,"x":0.13064133259778574,"y":0.19912790675631942,"h":0.015988372621082214,"text":"And kills my love with idleness."},{"text":"\"Why have you created me, my Father, with an enemy like this,","conf":1,"w":0.69358667150720366,"y":0.17584325406209889,"x":0.11163896127727721,"h":0.01892418710012278},{"text":"And made me thus discordant;","conf":1,"w":0.33076008883389563,"x":0.13039282639267125,"y":0.16415743003847227,"h":0.017223999613807273},{"y":0.14970930317723119,"conf":1,"text":"Why did you not give me oneness and pureness of soul?","x":0.12826606490200509,"w":0.59619948151823765,"h":0.01598837072887116},{"w":0.50356292724609375,"conf":1,"h":0.017482234372033001,"x":0.12826604651155318,"y":0.13368055585047678,"text":"Cleanse me, unify me, O healing waters of life!"},{"y":0.10987925290839951,"h":0.019549659320286294,"text":"\"Free me, cleanse me, O my Father, kill this enemy,","conf":1,"x":0.10912456324379438,"w":0.56795724645837564},{"h":0.017447627726055348,"text":"Slay and drown this me!\"","y":0.097383721647645194,"x":0.12826603805887968,"w":0.28028503021636564,"conf":1},{"w":0.038004751329298148,"text":"97","x":0.44893111606140002,"h":0.01744185932098874,"y":0.074127907694156892,"conf":1}],"h":11508}